# GX-1: generate, play, switch parts while playing (queued at the boundary), lock, mutate, undo, the GM map
wait 300
gx new breaks 1
expect mode 1
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect playing 1
expect notes_on >40
shot gx_breaks.png
gx part 4
wait 15500
gx part 3
gx lock 0 1
gx compose 77
gx mutate 1 3 60
gx undo
gx redo
gx macro 0 100
wait 4000
expect notes_on >200
gx map gm
gx new autonomic 9 5
wait 6000
gx new deep_dnb 3 2
wait 6000
expect playing 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
shot gx_end.png
